  "goodToKnow": "Der Waffenstillstand is a ceasefire or armistice: einen Waffenstillstand vereinbaren, brechen. The armistice of 11 November 1918, signed in a railway carriage at Compiègne, ended WWI fighting; Hitler had the French sign their surrender in the same carriage in 1940. Die Waffenruhe is a (often temporary) ceasefire; the Korean War ended only with a Waffenstillstand, not a peace treaty. Plural: die Waffenstillstände."
